; Without an entity every `@s` command fails on its own and the function continues (vanilla).
; The optimizer must keep each command's null check even after merging the shared `@s` lookup.
@setup
objective create t dummy

@function run
tag @s add a
tag @s add b
scoreboard players add @s t 1
execute as @s run tag @s add c
scoreboard players set done t 1

@validate
score done t is 1
